VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN top ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;
DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 20000 20000 ) ;
ROW row0 core 0 0 N DO 10 BY 1 STEP 400 0 ;
TRACKS X 200 DO 50 STEP 400 LAYER metal2 ;
VIAS 1 ;
- myvia + RECT metal1 ( -100 -100 ) ( 100 100 ) + RECT via ( -50 -50 ) ( 50 50 ) + RECT metal2 ( -100 -100 ) ( 100 100 ) ;
END VIAS
COMPONENTS 2 ;
- u1 inv + PLACED ( 1000 0 ) N ;
- u2 inv + FIXED ( 4000 0 ) FS ;
END COMPONENTS
PINS 2 ;
- in + NET in + DIRECTION INPUT + USE SIGNAL + LAYER metal1 ( -100 -100 ) ( 100 100 ) + PLACED ( 0 1000 ) N ;
- out + NET out + DIRECTION OUTPUT + LAYER metal2 ( -100 -100 ) ( 100 100 ) + FIXED ( 19000 1000 ) S ;
END PINS
SPECIALNETS 1 ;
- VDD ( * VDD ) + USE POWER + ROUTED metal1 400 ( 0 3600 ) ( 20000 * ) ;
END SPECIALNETS
NETS 3 ;
- in ( PIN in ) ( u1 A ) + ROUTED metal1 ( 0 1000 ) ( 1200 * ) ;
- mid ( u1 Y ) ( u2 A ) + ROUTED metal2 ( 1900 1500 ) ( * 5000 ) M1M2 NEW metal1 ( 1900 5000 ) ( 4200 * ) myvia ;
- out ( u2 Y ) ( PIN out ) + ROUTED metal2 ( 4900 1500 ) ( 19000 * ) ;
END NETS
END DESIGN
